title One Model Call - Historical Implementation
participant AgentLoop as Loop
participant "Provider routing" as Routing
participant "Mate adapter" as Provider
participant "Mate HTTP service" as Mate
participant "Runtime projection" as Projector
Loop -> Routing : Stream current context and tool definitions
Routing -> Provider : Select configured CampusMate provider
Provider -> Mate : Send one Chat request
Mate -->> Provider : SSE chunks
Provider -->> Loop : Typed Assistant deltas
Loop -->> Projector : Internal message updates
Projector -> Projector : Best-effort public preview
Mate --> Provider : DONE
Provider --> Loop : Complete Assistant and usage
Loop -> Loop : Append complete Assistant to context
Loop -> Projector : Message end
Projector -> Projector : Persist complete output, then publish
note over Loop,Projector
  Tool calls continue through the tool pipeline.
  Server internals are outside the historical source scope.
end note
