title One Mate Tool Call - Historical Implementation
participant ToolPipeline as Pipeline
participant "CallMateTool" as Tool
participant "Trusted discovery" as Discovery
participant Mate
Pipeline -> Tool : Execute after Runtime permission hook
Tool -> Discovery : Resolve business name
alt Cached binding exists
  Discovery --> Tool : Tool identity
else Cache miss
  Discovery -> Mate : Query Agent and directly bound Skill metadata
  Mate --> Discovery : Complete source metadata
  Discovery -> Discovery : Reject conflicts; publish complete index
  Discovery --> Tool : Identity or discovery error
end
break Unresolved name or discovery error
  Tool --> Pipeline : Controlled failure; no execute
end
Tool -> Mate : Execute resolved target with scoped credentials
Mate --> Tool : Business result
Tool --> Pipeline : Tool result or controlled failure
note over Tool,Discovery
  Unresolved names return without execute.
  Discovery sends no execution credentials.
  Historical order differs from the current CallTool target.
end note
@enduml

